cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "malariafwd: Forward Simulation of Plasmodium vivax Transmission and Genetics"
abstract: >-
  An R interface to a SLiM (Eidos) + tskit individual-based forward simulator of
  Plasmodium vivax malaria. Models blood-stage infection, the hypnozoite reservoir
  and relapses, meiotic recombination in the mosquito, and importation/interventions
  on a neutral 14-chromosome PvP01 genome, recording a tree sequence for ground-truth
  identity-by-descent.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/shaziaruybal/malariafwd"
url: "https://shaziaruybal.github.io/malariafwd/"
